<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">44.067 Turkey</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Strickland, Robert W; TFG Newsletter, Oct 94, p22</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Facet pattern intended to look like a turkey</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="284">including head and beak.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="302">Angles for R.I. = 1.760</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="320">57 facets + 17 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="338">1-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="356">L/W = 1.333  T/W = 0.147  U/W = 0.111</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="374">P/W = 0.423 C/W = 0.248</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="392">Vol/W&#179; = 0.329</tspan>
